The planning, styling, review, and plotting guidance has been adapted into
native Codex skill instructions. Direct model API clients and mandatory
benchmark retrieval have been replaced by host-provided capabilities,
optional user references, and authored layout heuristics. The adaptation adds
saved specifications, bounded revision history, preservation of useful
legends, and an explicit native SVG path. No upstream benchmark score is
claimed for this adaptation.

